WEBVTT

00:01:30.620 --> 00:01:32.500
Bow.

00:01:34.180 --> 00:01:36.970
My name is Kikyo Kiri.

00:01:36.970 --> 00:01:39.560
I was born and raised in Hokkaido...

00:01:39.560 --> 00:01:44.150
and moved here when I heard
of the staff opening.

00:01:44.150 --> 00:01:49.090
This will be my first time teaching
and may be lost at first...

00:01:49.090 --> 00:01:52.560
and would appreciate your
guidance and support.

00:01:50.890 --> 00:01:55.890
Mandarin Orange Reunion

00:02:01.490 --> 00:02:04.580
I never thought Kiri would
come to Nadesico.

00:02:04.580 --> 00:02:05.770
Hiroki.

00:02:06.170 --> 00:02:08.320
Skipping class again?

00:02:08.320 --> 00:02:09.670
You'll fail the course.

00:02:09.970 --> 00:02:11.010
Look who's talking, Ren.

00:02:11.010 --> 00:02:14.890
I had a photo shoot for a magazine
and arrived late.

00:02:14.890 --> 00:02:16.080
Fine, fine.

00:02:16.080 --> 00:02:19.290
Why don't you be the art
club's next model, then?

00:02:19.290 --> 00:02:22.420
I'm thinking of having them draw
the human figure next month.

00:02:22.420 --> 00:02:26.190
All right, but I won't pose nude. But...

00:02:26.660 --> 00:02:29.060
I would pose nude for you.

00:02:29.060 --> 00:02:29.870
What?

00:02:29.870 --> 00:02:31.740
The superintendent told
me the other day...

00:02:31.740 --> 00:02:35.370
you used to paint amazing
paintings in high school.

00:02:37.730 --> 00:02:39.200
Sorry,

00:02:40.430 --> 00:02:42.070
but I only draw busty girls.

00:02:43.230 --> 00:02:44.010
You jerk.

00:02:44.010 --> 00:02:44.970
Later.

00:02:45.270 --> 00:02:46.040
Where are you going?

00:02:46.480 --> 00:02:47.790
To the cafeteria.

00:02:52.290 --> 00:02:53.680
Thank you.

00:02:53.680 --> 00:02:56.300
No, thank you.

00:02:56.680 --> 00:03:01.530
Our school has many students
who excel in the arts...

00:03:01.530 --> 00:03:03.690
but we were considering
strengthening...

00:03:03.690 --> 00:03:05.930
our physical education program as well.

00:03:06.340 --> 00:03:07.200
Yes.

00:03:07.590 --> 00:03:12.140
Kikyo-sensei, I was also hoping you
would coach the basketball club.

00:03:12.500 --> 00:03:15.610
Yes, I will lead the team to an
intramural victory this year.

00:03:16.840 --> 00:03:19.040
Do you have any other questions?

00:03:19.040 --> 00:03:20.380
Not in particular.

00:03:24.400 --> 00:03:26.550
Where is the cafeteria?

00:03:27.580 --> 00:03:29.600
Here you are.

00:03:30.450 --> 00:03:34.290
Sensei, thanks for waiting.

00:03:34.290 --> 00:03:35.870
I haven't been waiting long...

00:03:35.870 --> 00:03:37.370
and I'm not a teacher.

00:03:37.370 --> 00:03:39.450
Whatever.

00:03:39.450 --> 00:03:41.070
Let's eat.

00:03:41.070 --> 00:03:43.370
You can't just sit here.

00:03:45.810 --> 00:03:47.250
Look, Sensei.

00:03:47.250 --> 00:03:48.910
I split them beautifully.

00:03:48.910 --> 00:03:50.370
Look, look.

00:03:50.370 --> 00:03:52.180
Okay, okay. Got it.

00:03:52.180 --> 00:03:54.580
You're no fun.

00:03:55.740 --> 00:03:56.580
What's wrong?

00:03:56.580 --> 00:03:58.550
You seem anxious.

00:03:58.550 --> 00:04:00.500
Not really.

00:04:02.500 --> 00:04:04.460
It's the new PE teacher.

00:04:08.360 --> 00:04:09.260
What's this?

00:04:09.600 --> 00:04:11.700
I'll have the A lunch.

00:04:11.700 --> 00:04:13.540
You want me to go buy it?

00:04:13.540 --> 00:04:15.330
We haven't seen each other in years.

00:04:15.330 --> 00:04:17.170
It's the least you can do.

00:04:17.170 --> 00:04:19.140
Oh, come on.

00:04:19.570 --> 00:04:21.540
You haven't changed.

00:04:21.880 --> 00:04:23.970
Oh, and I want extra rice! Thanks!

00:04:23.970 --> 00:04:24.760
Fine, fine.

00:04:24.760 --> 00:04:28.080
Do you two know each other?

00:04:28.750 --> 00:04:31.020
Yes, we're childhood friends.

00:04:31.020 --> 00:04:34.480
That's amazing. You'll have
to tell me all about it.

00:04:34.480 --> 00:04:38.190
I'm Hagino Kana. Nice to
meet you, Kikyo-sensei.

00:04:38.850 --> 00:04:40.730
Nice to meet you.

00:04:48.100 --> 00:04:51.100
It's hard to stop eating when
the food's this good.

00:04:51.350 --> 00:04:54.240
I never thought you'd come here.

00:04:54.570 --> 00:04:59.010
I looked for work at home, but
I couldn't find anything.

00:04:59.370 --> 00:05:03.360
I heard Nadesico happened to have
an opening for a PE teacher.

00:05:03.680 --> 00:05:04.660
I see.

00:05:05.160 --> 00:05:08.390
I thought you would head
straight into art school.

00:05:09.130 --> 00:05:11.360
I didn't expect you to take a year off.

00:05:12.030 --> 00:05:15.160
And now you're enrolled in Nadesico.

00:05:15.160 --> 00:05:16.390
I see.

00:05:16.390 --> 00:05:21.500
You haven't seen each other since
you parted ways in high school.

00:05:21.500 --> 00:05:23.150
What are you, a tabloid journalist?

00:05:23.150 --> 00:05:27.300
But Sensei, I don't know
anything about this.

00:05:28.000 --> 00:05:29.040
Sensei?

00:05:29.040 --> 00:05:32.480
I entered the education department.

00:05:32.480 --> 00:05:34.870
I'm thinking of becoming an art teacher.

00:05:34.870 --> 00:05:37.070
But he's the acting advisor
of the art club...

00:05:37.070 --> 00:05:39.700
and spends his time hanging
around the high school...

00:05:39.700 --> 00:05:42.300
so everyone calls him Sensei.

00:05:42.300 --> 00:05:43.380
Right, Sensei?

00:05:43.380 --> 00:05:44.990
I told you, I'm not a teacher.

00:05:46.230 --> 00:05:48.810
Well, it's tough making
a living just painting...

00:05:48.810 --> 00:05:51.400
and you can keep painting
as an art teacher.

00:05:56.050 --> 00:05:59.600
Well, I'm full. Thanks for the food.

00:05:57.790 --> 00:05:59.600
Excuse me.

00:05:59.600 --> 00:06:00.440
Huh?

00:06:00.890 --> 00:06:03.050
Onii-chan, can I sit with you?

00:06:03.050 --> 00:06:03.990
Sure.

00:06:05.730 --> 00:06:08.590
You've really grown, Elis-chan.

00:06:08.590 --> 00:06:11.600
When I saw you at the gates,
I didn't recognize you.

00:06:12.410 --> 00:06:14.810
She's still a kid on the inside.

00:06:14.810 --> 00:06:17.190
I think I'm mature enough.

00:06:17.610 --> 00:06:20.520
I didn't think Elis would enroll here, too.

00:06:20.810 --> 00:06:24.450
She just came here from
Hokkaido last week, too.

00:06:24.450 --> 00:06:25.340
Really?

00:06:25.340 --> 00:06:27.200
Now we're living together.

00:06:27.200 --> 00:06:28.200
What?

00:06:28.200 --> 00:06:31.450
I'm just her guardian.

00:06:32.530 --> 00:06:33.600
Onii-chan, can I have this?

00:06:33.600 --> 00:06:35.120
Hey!

00:06:35.120 --> 00:06:36.270
Delicious.

00:06:36.270 --> 00:06:39.210
Remember these flavors so
you can cook this tonight.

00:06:39.210 --> 00:06:42.010
You two get along just like siblings.

00:06:43.860 --> 00:06:44.920
Hey.

00:06:47.910 --> 00:06:50.320
We're not siblings, we're cousins.

00:06:50.320 --> 00:06:53.730
I'm sure you enjoy living
with such a cute sister.

00:06:53.730 --> 00:06:55.330
Well, you know...

00:06:55.330 --> 00:06:57.200
He moves around so much in his sleep.

00:06:57.200 --> 00:06:59.030
Yesterday, he kicked me out of bed.

00:06:59.030 --> 00:07:01.450
Oh, you sleep together?

00:07:01.450 --> 00:07:05.220
She forces her way into my bed.

00:07:06.160 --> 00:07:07.740
Sounds like you're really having fun.

00:07:07.740 --> 00:07:10.810
I'm still growing.

00:07:10.810 --> 00:07:14.240
If you're not careful, you'll
be in trouble soon.

00:07:10.810 --> 00:07:14.240
Well, I've got to go to class.

00:07:24.990 --> 00:07:26.350
Excuse me.

00:07:26.350 --> 00:07:27.590
What?

00:07:27.590 --> 00:07:29.610
I'm Hagino Kana, a sophomore.

00:07:29.610 --> 00:07:31.430
No way. You're an upperclassman?

00:07:31.430 --> 00:07:34.360
Could you tell me how you're
feeling right now?

00:07:34.360 --> 00:07:35.070
Huh?

00:07:35.340 --> 00:07:38.870
Your precious brother's childhood
friend has suddenly appeared.

00:07:38.870 --> 00:07:40.590
How do you feel about that?

00:07:40.590 --> 00:07:43.040
Why are you asking me?

00:07:43.040 --> 00:07:44.980
I need reference for my book.

00:07:45.600 --> 00:07:47.880
You're writing a book?

00:07:48.280 --> 00:07:51.610
It's certainly romantic to end up
with your childhood friend...

00:07:51.610 --> 00:07:54.280
but there's something dirty about
two siblings together.

00:07:54.280 --> 00:07:56.000
It's not something I'd like
to write about...

00:07:56.000 --> 00:07:59.920
but I should get some
information anyway.

00:08:05.740 --> 00:08:08.520
Well, it's tough making
a living just painting...

00:08:08.520 --> 00:08:10.800
and you can keep painting
as an art teacher.

00:08:14.290 --> 00:08:17.750
I can't tell her I'm not
painting any more.

00:08:18.360 --> 00:08:20.180
Yeah, but isn't that...

00:08:21.720 --> 00:08:23.440
Childhood friends, huh?

00:08:30.400 --> 00:08:31.860
Amazing!

00:08:36.600 --> 00:08:38.560
I like you.

00:08:38.560 --> 00:08:41.600
I like you, Hiroki.

00:08:46.090 --> 00:08:48.880
Say something.

00:08:49.910 --> 00:08:51.440
Nadesico!

00:08:51.440 --> 00:08:54.300
Let's go, let's go!

00:08:54.300 --> 00:08:55.750
Here's a ball.

00:08:56.310 --> 00:08:58.480
It was rolling around outside the gym.

00:08:59.490 --> 00:09:00.350
Thanks.

00:09:01.990 --> 00:09:04.520
Sensei, what should we do?

00:09:05.230 --> 00:09:08.650
Shoot ten shots from the three
left and right center positions.

00:09:08.650 --> 00:09:09.690
Okay.

00:09:10.420 --> 00:09:11.830
Well, what do you know...

00:09:11.830 --> 00:09:12.630
Huh?

00:09:13.030 --> 00:09:15.500
This reminds me of our high school days.

00:09:15.500 --> 00:09:18.100
You were obsessed with
basketball then...

00:09:18.590 --> 00:09:20.160
and always drenched in sweat.

00:09:21.350 --> 00:09:24.000
And you were always covered in paint.

00:09:24.690 --> 00:09:27.720
Keep up the good work, Kikyo-sensei.

00:09:27.720 --> 00:09:28.550
Huh?

00:09:29.220 --> 00:09:30.340
Hey!

00:09:30.340 --> 00:09:31.470
What?

00:09:31.470 --> 00:09:33.080
Are you done for the day?

00:09:33.410 --> 00:09:34.180
Yeah.

00:09:34.520 --> 00:09:37.590
Could I stop by your place tonight?

00:09:37.590 --> 00:09:38.800
What?

00:09:38.800 --> 00:09:42.680
I'll make the hamburger Elis requested.

00:09:44.220 --> 00:09:46.800
I'd like to chat with you some more, too.

00:09:48.120 --> 00:09:49.030
Would that be okay?

00:09:49.510 --> 00:09:50.300
Well...

00:09:51.130 --> 00:09:53.020
Then why don't we go
shopping together?

00:09:53.020 --> 00:09:55.140
I'm not familiar with the area.

00:09:55.770 --> 00:09:56.870
Sure.

00:09:56.870 --> 00:09:59.090
I'll be waiting for you at
the gates at 5 o'clock.

00:09:59.090 --> 00:09:59.990
5 o'clock, okay?

00:09:59.990 --> 00:10:00.820
Okay.

00:10:05.030 --> 00:10:07.320
I never thought in a place like this...

00:10:07.760 --> 00:10:10.350
I never thought we would meet again...

00:10:12.190 --> 00:10:13.700
That I would see the man
who turned me down.

00:10:34.420 --> 00:10:35.390
President.

00:10:35.390 --> 00:10:36.380
Yes?

00:10:36.380 --> 00:10:39.350
I just met with Kamikura-sensei.

00:10:39.640 --> 00:10:41.510
Something came up...

00:10:41.510 --> 00:10:43.950
and he won't be coming
to the art club today.

00:10:43.950 --> 00:10:44.730
I see.

00:10:44.730 --> 00:10:46.440
Thank you.

00:10:51.730 --> 00:10:56.120
You can draw even if your Onii-chan
isn't here, can't you?

00:10:56.770 --> 00:11:02.820
Yes, but I wouldn't be drawing
if not for him.

00:11:14.430 --> 00:11:16.680
Onii-chan, hello!

00:11:16.680 --> 00:11:17.890
Hello.

00:11:18.820 --> 00:11:20.900
You brought your sketchbook again!

00:11:20.900 --> 00:11:22.330
Let me see, let me see!

00:11:22.330 --> 00:11:23.760
Sure, later.

00:11:24.030 --> 00:11:25.730
Promise?

00:11:26.800 --> 00:11:28.430
I won't forget.

00:11:30.200 --> 00:11:32.640
Elis, I'm coming in.

00:11:35.570 --> 00:11:37.000
How are you feeling?

00:11:39.020 --> 00:11:43.050
Look, I found these flowers
blooming near the hospital.

00:11:44.910 --> 00:11:46.850
And these dogs were taking a walk.

00:11:46.850 --> 00:11:50.750
And this delicious looking
cake was for sale, too.

00:11:54.320 --> 00:11:56.590
Why don't you try drawing too, Elis?

00:11:57.400 --> 00:11:59.570
I'll leave these here.

00:12:00.900 --> 00:12:04.500
I couldn't go outside myself...

00:12:04.500 --> 00:12:07.830
so Onii-chan drew pictures
for me every day.

00:12:08.250 --> 00:12:11.740
I drew instead of speaking.

00:12:11.740 --> 00:12:13.110
I'm sorry.

00:12:13.110 --> 00:12:15.180
It seems I said something hurtful.

00:12:15.180 --> 00:12:16.550
It's fine.

00:12:16.550 --> 00:12:19.220
That's one of the things I like about you.

00:12:20.540 --> 00:12:23.820
Let me draw you sometime.

00:12:27.500 --> 00:12:31.330
Not even your Onii-chan would
be able to resist you.

00:12:33.910 --> 00:12:35.820
Sorry, sorry.

00:12:35.820 --> 00:12:37.410
I can't believe you kept me waiting.

00:12:37.410 --> 00:12:39.900
You're the one who said 5 o'clock.

00:12:39.900 --> 00:12:40.990
Oh, come on.

00:12:40.990 --> 00:12:42.830
A working adult has a lot to deal with...

00:12:42.830 --> 00:12:45.250
though I suppose a student wouldn't
know anything about that.

00:12:45.250 --> 00:12:47.550
We were always classmates...

00:12:47.550 --> 00:12:49.720
but you sure like to set us apart.

00:12:52.570 --> 00:12:54.980
From now on, call me your Onee-sama!

00:12:54.980 --> 00:12:57.260
You can forget about that.

00:13:01.430 --> 00:13:02.980
Which one?

00:13:02.980 --> 00:13:04.530
Wait three minutes.

00:13:04.530 --> 00:13:05.830
We'll save 100 yen.

00:13:06.310 --> 00:13:08.980
You sound like a parent.

00:13:08.980 --> 00:13:11.200
Money's pretty tight.

00:13:11.540 --> 00:13:12.610
Oh, that's right.

00:13:12.610 --> 00:13:15.130
Your art supplies must be expensive.

00:13:15.770 --> 00:13:18.640
She isn't saying that because
she knows, is she?

00:13:21.180 --> 00:13:23.150
By the way, have you seen Yanagi-kun?

00:13:23.680 --> 00:13:27.990
Didn't he enter a contest and
become a professional artist?

00:13:29.480 --> 00:13:30.550
Yeah.

00:13:31.280 --> 00:13:34.450
I haven't seen him at all.

00:13:36.150 --> 00:13:37.700
It's 100 yen off now!

00:13:37.700 --> 00:13:39.710
Yes, our limited offer starts now.

00:13:39.710 --> 00:13:41.200
Could I get a sticker on this, too?

00:13:41.200 --> 00:13:42.020
Yes, ma'am.

00:13:46.140 --> 00:13:48.380
You live in a nice place.

00:13:48.380 --> 00:13:50.610
Some relatives are renting
it out to me cheap.

00:13:50.610 --> 00:13:52.360
Luck you.

00:13:57.080 --> 00:13:59.150
Elis? What's wrong?

00:13:59.960 --> 00:14:03.050
You're late, and you skipped
art club, too.

00:14:03.740 --> 00:14:05.350
Sorry, sorry.

00:14:05.350 --> 00:14:06.690
Excuse the intrusion.

00:14:08.700 --> 00:14:11.380
Kiri said she'd make dinner.

00:14:11.380 --> 00:14:13.080
You must be hungry.

00:14:13.080 --> 00:14:14.720
I'll get started right away.

00:14:15.240 --> 00:14:18.670
It's been a while since someone's
cooked for me.

00:14:18.670 --> 00:14:22.170
I just made you yakisoba the other day.

00:14:22.170 --> 00:14:24.170
I wouldn't call that food.

00:14:24.170 --> 00:14:25.550
That's awful.

00:14:25.550 --> 00:14:28.150
Next time I'll make you
something delicious!

00:14:28.150 --> 00:14:29.250
Elis.

00:14:30.160 --> 00:14:31.420
What?

00:14:32.420 --> 00:14:34.550
Whatever you do, don't cook yakisoba.

00:14:39.240 --> 00:14:42.020
I was just kidding.

00:14:43.010 --> 00:14:44.800
I know!

00:14:47.800 --> 00:14:48.900
Delicious.

00:14:48.900 --> 00:14:50.050
Isn't it?

00:14:50.050 --> 00:14:53.080
The secret is instead of
using bread crumbs...

00:14:53.080 --> 00:14:55.870
I use real pieces of bread
dipped in milk!

00:14:55.870 --> 00:14:56.870
I'll have to remember that.

00:14:57.710 --> 00:14:59.670
Sorry, Elis-chan.

00:15:00.760 --> 00:15:02.630
I haven't cooked this in a while.

00:15:02.630 --> 00:15:04.920
How is it? Do you like it?

00:15:04.920 --> 00:15:07.460
It's a hundred times better than
what Onii-chan cooks.

00:15:07.460 --> 00:15:08.350
Hey!

00:15:09.130 --> 00:15:10.520
How is Nadesico?

00:15:10.520 --> 00:15:12.740
Do you think you'll have fun there?

00:15:12.740 --> 00:15:13.970
I think so.

00:15:13.970 --> 00:15:17.790
It's an art school, so it'll
be perfect for you.

00:15:17.790 --> 00:15:19.750
And he'll be there, too.

00:15:20.300 --> 00:15:24.800
The only thing you can
do is paint, anyway.

00:15:24.800 --> 00:15:27.490
You always say that.

00:15:27.490 --> 00:15:32.360
You'd shower me with praise every
time you saw my work.

00:15:32.710 --> 00:15:37.760
I started drawing when I studied
with Elis' mother...

00:15:37.760 --> 00:15:42.130
but I kept it up because you
loved my drawings so much.

00:15:42.130 --> 00:15:43.550
I'm done!

00:15:44.760 --> 00:15:46.190
Elis, what's wrong with you?

00:15:46.570 --> 00:15:48.130
At least clean up after yourself.

00:15:49.660 --> 00:15:55.100
I started drawing because
you taught me how...

00:15:55.460 --> 00:15:57.550
and because you praised me for it!

00:15:57.550 --> 00:15:58.770
Got it?

00:16:00.530 --> 00:16:02.820
What's gotten into her?

00:16:02.820 --> 00:16:04.030
Sorry about that.

00:16:04.950 --> 00:16:07.620
You shouldn't be apologizing to me.

00:16:07.620 --> 00:16:08.310
What?

00:16:08.850 --> 00:16:12.720
All you can do is draw. You're
terrible at everything else.

00:16:12.720 --> 00:16:14.790
By the way, where's your room?

00:16:15.470 --> 00:16:17.790
Hey, hold on. Don't just...

00:16:17.790 --> 00:16:18.660
Hey!

00:16:20.700 --> 00:16:22.830
You keep it pretty tidy.

00:16:21.490 --> 00:16:22.830
Are you even listening?

00:16:26.140 --> 00:16:28.880
Are you renting a studio somewhere?

00:16:28.880 --> 00:16:30.630
There isn't any art here.

00:16:31.550 --> 00:16:34.670
Show me something you're
working on now.

00:16:37.060 --> 00:16:38.370
What's wrong?

00:16:39.140 --> 00:16:40.180
I don't have anything.

00:16:40.180 --> 00:16:41.180
What?

00:16:41.550 --> 00:16:43.960
I'm not painting any more.

00:16:45.980 --> 00:16:47.280
Not a single painting.

00:16:48.120 --> 00:16:49.450
You're lying.

00:16:50.760 --> 00:16:51.960
It's true.

00:16:52.570 --> 00:16:53.790
Why?

00:16:54.270 --> 00:16:56.730
You loved painting so much.

00:16:56.980 --> 00:17:02.570
I prefer teaching girls to draw
than drawing myself.

00:17:02.570 --> 00:17:03.970
Don't give me that!

00:17:07.490 --> 00:17:08.720
Onii-chan?

00:17:13.190 --> 00:17:14.510
Kiri-san!

00:17:23.960 --> 00:17:25.180
Kiri-san!

00:17:29.580 --> 00:17:30.630
Here.

00:17:33.870 --> 00:17:36.500
Elis-chan, did you know?

00:17:37.030 --> 00:17:39.500
Did you know he isn't painting?

00:17:40.500 --> 00:17:41.810
Yes.

00:17:41.810 --> 00:17:47.020
He stopped drawing after he
graduated from high school.

00:17:47.020 --> 00:17:51.260
He won't tell me why, no matter
how many times I ask.

00:17:52.620 --> 00:17:53.720
I see.

00:17:56.090 --> 00:17:57.440
Thank you.

00:18:03.150 --> 00:18:04.590
Oh, that's right.

00:18:06.290 --> 00:18:07.570
Elis-chan...

00:18:09.620 --> 00:18:12.980
I'm lost.

00:18:16.410 --> 00:18:19.630
I can't believe you need help, Kiri-san.

00:18:20.160 --> 00:18:22.810
Sorry, he tells me that a lot, too.

00:18:24.150 --> 00:18:25.410
Kiri-san...

00:18:25.910 --> 00:18:26.910
Huh?

00:18:27.630 --> 00:18:29.850
Did you date Onii-chan?

00:18:31.210 --> 00:18:34.530
We weren't dating, but...

00:18:34.530 --> 00:18:37.590
Did you go on dates together?

00:18:37.940 --> 00:18:41.300
Well, we would go out together.

00:18:46.490 --> 00:18:49.910
Did you kiss?

00:18:51.650 --> 00:18:53.030
Who knows.

00:18:53.680 --> 00:18:55.560
What about you, Elis-chan?

00:18:55.560 --> 00:18:57.110
How is living with him?

00:19:00.400 --> 00:19:01.650
It has its charm.

00:19:07.600 --> 00:19:08.700
Thank you.

00:19:08.700 --> 00:19:10.220
I know my way from here.

00:19:11.250 --> 00:19:12.400
Are you all right?

00:19:12.400 --> 00:19:14.970
Should I call him and tell
you to pick you up?

00:19:14.970 --> 00:19:16.060
I'm fine.

00:19:16.060 --> 00:19:17.820
Be careful, Kiri-san.

00:19:18.540 --> 00:19:19.570
Bye.

00:19:35.980 --> 00:19:38.090
Did she say anything?

00:19:38.500 --> 00:19:39.570
No.

00:19:45.200 --> 00:19:47.420
Shouldn't you walk her home?

00:19:47.420 --> 00:19:48.610
She'll be fine.

00:19:48.610 --> 00:19:51.680
She used to do karate and aikido.

00:19:55.080 --> 00:19:56.090
Elis.

00:19:56.090 --> 00:19:57.210
What?

00:19:57.600 --> 00:20:00.340
You're washing the dishes
when we get home.

00:20:00.700 --> 00:20:01.710
What?

00:20:01.710 --> 00:20:04.090
No fair, Onii-chan.

00:20:04.090 --> 00:20:05.070
There's nothing unfair about it.

00:20:05.070 --> 00:20:06.240
No fair, no fair.

00:20:06.240 --> 00:20:08.360
You've got to clean up after yourself.

00:20:29.340 --> 00:20:30.610
Onii-chan?

00:20:35.460 --> 00:20:36.580
Lucky me.

00:20:43.650 --> 00:20:45.890
Did you kiss?

00:20:46.270 --> 00:20:47.290
Who knows.

00:21:11.560 --> 00:21:14.010
Good night, Onii-chan.

00:21:16.430 --> 00:21:22.040
I'll be seeing her all the time again.

00:21:24.440 --> 00:21:25.920
I'm happy...

00:21:26.560 --> 00:21:27.630
but it hurts.

00:23:11.130 --> 00:23:13.940
Canary yellow is a cheerful color...

00:23:13.940 --> 00:23:15.860
with a mischievous and capricious side.

00:23:15.860 --> 00:23:16.930
By the way, Onii-chan...

00:23:16.930 --> 00:23:21.180
why do men love being
used by clumsy girls?

00:23:21.180 --> 00:23:22.380
It's not as though we like it.

00:23:22.380 --> 00:23:24.260
You'll get tired of spending
so much time...

00:23:24.260 --> 00:23:26.380
with someone so unpredictable.

00:23:26.380 --> 00:23:27.260
You're right.

00:23:27.260 --> 00:23:27.880
I know.

00:23:27.880 --> 00:23:31.820
But your selfishness can
be pretty tiring, too.

00:23:32.110 --> 00:23:33.640
Really?

00:23:33.640 --> 00:23:36.150
Next time, “Mischievous
Canary Yellow.”

00:23:36.150 --> 00:23:38.220
Always approach love with unanimity!
